## What to deliver

Build the car sprite up operation by operation until the image in `canvas.png`
matches the brief — a top-down sedan with a rounded body, a glass cabin, four
wheels at the corners, headlights at the front and taillights at the rear, facing
right across the 64x32 canvas, in the car palette on full transparency. When you are
satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json` is your finished submission.
